}, {"image": "engenn4le11ob01re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Aunt Nelly</span>: What are you going to do today, Vanessa?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I want to visit a new district! Where should I go?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Aunt Nelly</span>: Hmm, how about Japantown?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Japantown? Sounds exotic!<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Aunt Nelly</span>: Yes, there are many things to see there.", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn4le11ob01re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: How do I get there?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Aunt Nelly</span>: Well, do you remember how to get to Haight-Ashbury?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yes.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Aunt Nelly</span>: From there, you could take a bus up Divisadero Street to Geary Boulevard.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: OK.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Aunt Nelly</span>: When you get to Geary, transfer to bus #16. That takes you by Japantown.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: What's in Japantown?", "time": "18000", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn4le11ob01re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Aunt Nelly</span>: The Peace Pagoda is delightful, and there are many restaurants you can try.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sounds great!<br /></br>\n<span class=\"strong\">On the radio:</span> Up next,  we go to Japantown and talk to the fishermen.<br /><br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Aunt Nelly</span>: Oh, I almost forgot! You should visit the fish market! <br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: What a coincidence!", "time": "43000", "id": 3}]}}], "id": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": 